# neAGENCIJA WordPress plugins

Applies to all plugins under `D:\_WORDPRESS\_Plugins` (folders `nea-*`).

## 1. Plugin Name

- Folder slug: lowercase kebab-case starting with `nea-` (e.g. `nea-image-copyright`).
- WordPress `Plugin Name` header **must** start with `neAGENCIJA` (exact casing).
- After the brand, put a space and the human-readable name.

```php
/**
 * Plugin Name: neAGENCIJA Image Copyright
 */
```

```php
// ❌ BAD
 * Plugin Name: NEA Image Copyright
 * Plugin Name: Image Copyright
```

## 2. Git Updater

Every plugin must be installable/updatable via [Git Updater](https://git-updater.com/).

When the user **first** provides the GitHub repository URL for a plugin, add these headers to the **main plugin PHP file** header comment (alongside Plugin Name, Version, etc.):

```php
 * GitHub Plugin URI: https://github.com/owner/repo
 * Primary Branch: main
```

Rules:

- Use the full HTTPS URL **without** `.git`.
- `Primary Branch` is **always** `main`.
- Do not invent a repo URL — only add/update these lines when the user supplies the link.
- If headers are missing and the user later shares the repo URL (e.g. for commit/push), add them in the same change before committing.

Example:

```php
/**
 * Plugin Name:       neAGENCIJA Image Copyright
 * Description:       …
 * Version:           1.1.0
 * Author:            neAGENCIJA
 * Text Domain:       nea-image-copyright
 * GitHub Plugin URI: https://github.com/gregamer/nea-image-copyright
 * Primary Branch:    main
 */
```
